fd838cb5cc0ebbbfd523b1b10ae2a0a013f6.600x338.jpg?t=1770780044"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/d9d3dd405ccf196ecff02ccd256062ff02b67eb2/ss_d9d3dd405ccf196ecff02ccd256062ff02b67eb2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770780044","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/d9d3dd405ccf196ecff02ccd256062ff02b67eb2/ss_d9d3dd405ccf196ecff02ccd256062ff02b67eb2.600x338.jpg?t=1770780044"}],"short_description":"It\u2019s not chess...it\u2019s better! COMBINE pieces as you play. New moves. New strategies. Create powerful hybrid pieces like the &quot;Knook&quot; by moving the Knight + Rook onto the same square. Then move as either piece. Face off with friends. Battle the AI. Beat the Grandmaster in the Deckbuilding Roguelike.","steam_appid":3273750,"support_info":{"email":"info@chessplus.com","url":"https://www.chessplus.com/pages/contact-us-1"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.chessplus.com/"}